OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for pair accused of
OL,4,Amurdering and dismembering man
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo suspects are to stand trial in 2028
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering a man and then
OL,8,Fdumping his dismembered remains.
OL,10,FDavid McColl, 51, and Linda Kelly, 48,
OL,11,Fallegedly killed Graham Wright on 21 or
OL,12,F22 August last year at a flat in
OL,13,FGlasgow's Gorbals area.
OL,15,FIt is claimed the 38 year-old was
OL,16,Ffatally assaulted by "means unknown".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
