OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for pair accused of
OL,4,Amurdering and dismembering man
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcColl, Kelly and 54 year-old John
OL,7,FJoseph Roarty also face a charge of
OL,8,Fattempting to defeat the ends of
OL,9,Fjustice by dismembering the victim and
OL,10,Fdisposing of his body parts in various
OL,11,Flocations, including Loch Lomond.
